n1=note("ORDERS\nPrices and totals are recalculated here from the catalogue, so a tampered browser cannot change the price. Orders outside the delivery area are saved as needs_review. Create a Google Sheet tab 'Orders' with the headers from sheets/Orders.csv. WhatsApp messages need approved templates: order_confirmation (4 text variables).\n"+STICKY_KEY,[0,20],640,260)
